    <string name="bg_title">Playing with the screen off</string>
    <string name="bg_intro">Some phones stop apps in the background to save battery. So that books keep playing:</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_xiaomi">1. App info → Battery saver → No restrictions\n2. App info → Autostart → on\n3. In Recents, pull the app\'s card down to lock it</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_huawei">1. Settings → Battery → App launch → this app: turn off \"Manage automatically\" and allow it to run in the background\n2. In Recents, pull the app\'s card down to lock it</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_samsung">1. App info → Battery → Unrestricted\n2. Settings → Battery → Background usage limits: keep this app out of \"Sleeping apps\" and \"Deep sleeping apps\"</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_oppo">1. App info → Battery usage → allow background activity and auto launch\n2. In Recents, lock the app\'s card</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_vivo">1. Settings → Battery → Background power consumption → this app → Allow\n2. App info → Permissions → Autostart → on\n3. In Recents, lock the app\'s card</string>
    <string name="bg_steps_other">1. App info → Battery → Unrestricted (or \"Don\'t optimize\")\n2. If the phone has an autostart or background-app setting, allow this app there too</string>
